{"text": "LEAVE ADMIN LOG - Presidio Title & Escrow Co. - kept by Monique Fairbanks, HR\nEmployee: Aguinaldo, Charlene   Emp# 004417   Escrow officer, Daly City branch   Hired 8/14/2017\nLeave case: LV-2025-088   Type: FMLA/CFRA intermittent, care of parent\n\n10/20/25  Charlene came by. Her father, Bienvenido Aguinaldo, age 93, lives with her at 72 Wellington Avenue, Daly City CA 94014. He fell on 10/17 and broke his hip; surgery at the county hospital on 10/18. She needs time for rehab visits and then to be home with him some afternoons. Gave her the WH-380-F and the 15-day deadline under 29 CFR 825.305. She has 1,250+ hours, eligible.\n\n10/29/25  Certification received by fax from Sunset Geriatric Associates, signed by Dr. Reuben Katzenberg (lic. G 44187), office 415-555-0123. Summary of what it says, for my own reference, original locked in the medical file:\n   - patient born 2/11/1932; conditions: hip fracture status post hemiarthroplasty, moderate Alzheimer's dementia, congestive heart failure\n   - needs help with transfers, meals, medication; cannot be left alone more than 2 hours\n   - leave needed: up to 3 half-days a week plus appointments, 10/20/2025 through 4/20/2026, then reassess\n   Complete and sufficient. Approved. Designation notice emailed to caguinaldo@presidiotitle.example and mailed.\n\n11/3  Charlene asked about pay. Explained PFL through the state, up to 8 weeks; she applies herself. Her claim ID once filed: R1000-441-877-20. Our piece is only the wage info: $38.75/hr, 40 hrs.\n\n11/6  Her supervisor asked me \"how old is the dad, ninety-something? how long can this go on.\" Told him the reason for leave is not his business and not to ask her. Noted here in case it comes up again.\n\n11/10  Charlene called from her cell (650-555-0178). Father readmitted overnight, pneumonia. She will be out all week. Told her that is covered; just text me the days. She mentioned her brother in Manila can't get a visa to come help so it is all on her. She was upset about money; told her about the hardship option in the 401(k) but did not push.\n\nUsage to date: 31.5 hrs of 480.   Next recert: not before 5/1/26.   MF", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "346 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Monique Fairbanks", "Charlene Aguinaldo", "Bienvenido Aguinaldo", "Reuben Katzenberg", "caguinaldo"], "companies": ["Presidio Title", "Sunset Geriatric Associates", "Presidio"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Daly City", "Daly City CA 94014", "Manila"], "health": ["hip fracture", "hemiarthroplasty", "moderate Alzheimer's dementia", "congestive heart failure", "pneumonia"], "sensitive": [], "names": ["Charlene", "Bienvenido", "Reuben"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 1, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.09999999403953552, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "street", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "region", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 18, "end": 45, "text": "Presidio Title & Escrow Co.", "kind": "company", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Presidio Title & Escrow Co."}, {"start": 56, "end": 73, "text": "Monique Fairbanks", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Monique Fairbanks"}, {"start": 88, "end": 107, "text": "Aguinaldo, Charlene", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Charlene Aguinaldo"}, {"start": 115, "end": 121, "text": "004417", "kind": "record", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "004417"}, {"start": 140, "end": 149, "text": "Daly City", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Daly City"}, {"start": 165, "end": 174, "text": "8/14/2017", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "8/14/2017"}, {"start": 187, "end": 198, "text": "LV-2